2. For the purposes of these Rules —
“container”, in relation to fresh fruits or vegetables, means the basket, carton, bag, box, packet or other receptacle which contains the fruits or vegetables and, where any such receptacle is contained in another such receptacle, includes the latter receptacle;
“licence” means a licence issued under section 31 of the Act for the import or transhipment of any fresh fruit or vegetable;
“licensee” means the holder of a licence;
“permit” means a permit issued under section 31 of the Act to a licensee for the import or transhipment of any consignment of fresh fruits or vegetables.
